Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_H0_0::
	.string "When I heard there was a strange\n"
	.string "house, I had to check it out.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_H0_1::
	.string "I've discovered a tough TRAINER!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_H0_2::
	.string "I'm sure having a good time checking\n"
	.string "this place out.\p"
	.string "It's a challenge I've found worth\n"
	.string "repeating!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_H1_0::
	.string "Maybe I could get my BIRD POKéMON\n"
	.string "to fly over the wall…$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_H1_1::
	.string "Gwaaah! I blew it!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_H1_2::
	.string "Ehehehe… I guess I lost because\n"
	.string "I was trying to cheat.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_H2_0::
	.string "I'm getting dizzy from these rotating\n"
	.string "doors…$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_H2_1::
	.string "Everything's spinning around and\n"
	.string "around. I can't take this anymore…$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_H2_2::
	.string "You don't seem to be affected at\n"
	.string "all. Or do you have your poker face\l"
	.string "on?$"

@ BEGIN PATCH (tools/hoenn_import/patches)
Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_BennyIntro::
    .string "The lamps in here go out behind\n"
    .string "you. That's deliberate.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_BennyDefeat::
    .string "I saw that one coming. Barely.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_BennyPostBattle::
    .string "Keep one hand on the wall and\n"
    .string "count the corners.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SebastianIntro::
    .string "In the dark, a trainer listens.\n"
    .string "Your POKéMON are noisy.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SebastianDefeat::
    .string "So were mine, it turns out.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SebastianPostBattle::
    .string "Light doesn't help in this room.\n"
    .string "Memory does.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SophiaIntro::
    .string "I like it dark. Fewer of his\n"
    .string "decorations to look at.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SophiaDefeat::
    .string "Beaten in the dark, too.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SophiaPostBattle::
    .string "The scroll is where the draught\n"
    .string "comes from.$"

